# Cloudflare Pages response headers — hardening for the public civic board.
# CSP deliberately omitted for now: the boot JSON is an inline script whose
# hash changes every build; adding a hash requires a build-time _headers
# generator. Do NOT add 'unsafe-inline' script CSP — it buys false comfort.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
